 'The Secuura checkout was touched only by read verbs (ls-remote, `config --get`, `show`, `cat-file`, `ls-tree`, `grep`, `merge-base`, and `clone --shared` as a source). Seat B 43rd\'s handover, record folder and session scratchpad were READ. GitHub: REST GET only. Linear: queries only. npm: the registry, for four `npm ci --ignore-scripts` runs of committed locks (no advisory call). AgentMail: ONE read-only API listing of wednesday-agent@ (GET messages?limit=100 — touches no seen-state; used ONLY to find the READY mail\'s id by the commissioned subject prefix) and ONE by-id read (inbox_digest.sh full); nothing sent. decisions.json and inbox_routing.conf: read only.', '',
