 '3. **"Zero vulnerable copies of any of the four remain" is true IN SCOPE (READ):** 0 across the 39 in-scope locks; the declared out-of-scope tree `Blockchain/Dev/mobile/secuura-app` (lock-discovery.mjs OUT_OF_SCOPE_LOCKS, KS-769 — Kam ruled it "Dormant but kept"; leg 7 does not audit it) pins **undici 6.28.0**, below the seat\'s own typed first-patched 6.28.1. Whether 6.28.0 is inside GHSA-3wwx-pv8p-q78v\'s real range the gate reads from the advisory. Not a blocker by itself (out of scope, not shipped); a qualifier the claim needs.',
